    "description": "scSNViz is an R package for exploring, quantifying, and visualizing expressed single-nucleotide variants (SNVs) from cell-barcoded single-cell RNA-seq data, supporting variant allele fraction estimation, SNV expression-profile clustering, and 2D/3D visualization, with integration into Seurat, Slingshot, scType, and CopyKat workflows.",
